flowchart TD
    DEV([Developer]) -->|push| GH[GitHub Repository]

    subgraph CICD[CI/CD - GitHub Actions]
        GH -->|push/PR| CI[ci.yml: ruff + pytest]
        GH -->|manual trigger| TRAIN_WF[train-codebuild.yml: start-build]
        GH -->|push main| DOCKER_WF[docker-ecr.yml: docker build + push]
    end

    subgraph TRAINING[Entrenamiento - AWS CodeBuild]
        TRAIN_WF --> CB[CodeBuild churn-training]
        CB --> P1[preprocess.py]
        P1 --> P2[build_feature_store.py]
        P2 --> P3[train.py + MLflow]
        P3 --> P4{evaluate.py quality gate}
        P4 -->|PASS| P5[register_model.py]
        P4 -->|FAIL| FAIL[Build failed]
    end

    subgraph STORAGE[Storage + Registry]
        S3[(Amazon S3: raw, feature_store, models, mlruns, reports)]
        DDB[(Amazon DynamoDB: churn-model-registry)]
        ECR[Amazon ECR: churn-api image]
    end

    subgraph INFERENCE[Deploy + Inferencia]
        EC2[Amazon EC2 t3.micro + Docker]
        API[FastAPI: health, predict, batch, docs]
        INF[inference.py]
        CLIENT([Cliente / Usuario])
    end

    subgraph MONITOR[Monitoreo]
        PRED[predict.py batch scoring]
        MON[monitor.py drift/PSI]
        CW[Amazon CloudWatch metrics/logs]
    end

    P2 -->|upload feature store| S3
    P3 -->|sync mlruns| S3
    P5 -->|upload model and metrics| S3
    P5 -->|put item Production| DDB
    CB -->|logs| CW
    DOCKER_WF -->|push image| ECR
    ECR -->|pull image| EC2
    EC2 --> API
    API --> INF
    INF -->|query Production| DDB
    INF -->|download model.joblib| S3
    CLIENT -->|POST /predict| API
    API -->|prediction| CLIENT
    CLIENT --> PRED
    PRED --> MON
    MON --> CW
    MON -->|report JSON| S3
